{
  "id": "pypi-sdist-agent-config-approved-upload-password",
  "title": "sdist packs the project's Claude Code local settings with an approved twine upload password",
  "category": "secret-retention",
  "intent": "sdists commonly pack the whole project directory, so .claude/settings.local.json ships with an approved `twine upload` command line holding its password. With no baseline every file is new, so the shared file.agent-config rule grades the inline credential critical. The value is synthetic and non-functional.",
